applications/open-datum/offchain/test/Singular/Application/OpenDatum/RecoverySpec.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; fixture refs accumulated for assertions
applications/open-datum/offchain/test/Singular/Application/OpenDatum/RegistryStateTokenSpec.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; fixture refs accumulated for assertions
applications/open-datum/offchain/test/Singular/Application/OpenDatum/StateTokenFixture.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; fixture refs accumulated for assertions
applications/open-datum/offchain/test/Singular/Application/OpenDatum/StateTokenSpec.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; fixture refs accumulated for assertions
applications/open-datum/offchain/test/Singular/Application/OpenDatum/TraceSpec.hs: async,ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; independent example shards joined by mapConcurrently_; trace refs accumulated for assertions
applications/open-datum/offchain/test/Singular/Application/OpenDatum/WalletShortfallSpec.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the wallet-floor examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; rig and flag refs accumulated for assertions
applications/open-datum/offchain/test/Singular/Application/OpenDatum/WriteSpec.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; fixture refs accumulated for assertions
applications/open-datum/offchain/test/Singular/Provider/Koios/FakeServer.hs: ioref — harness; owner=one fake-server session; lifetime=single example; serial; scripted-answer refs for the fake transport
applications/open-datum/offchain/test/Singular/Provider/Koios/Scripted.hs: ioref — harness; owner=one scripted session; lifetime=single example; serial; scripted-answer refs for the fake transport
applications/open-datum/offchain/test/Singular/Registry/RawChainFixture.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; raw-chain fixture refs for assertions
applications/open-datum/offchain/test/Singular/Registry/StubSession.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; stub-session refs for assertions
conformance/test/Conformance/Support/CliControls.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the control examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; control-state refs for assertions
conformance/test/Conformance/Support/Fixture.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; fixture refs accumulated for assertions
conformance/test/Conformance/Support/FoldHistory.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; fold-history refs for assertions
conformance/test/Conformance/Support/FoldSelection.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; selection refs for assertions
conformance/test/Conformance/Support/ObservedTx.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; observed-tx refs for assertions
conformance/test/Conformance/Support/RunReplay.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; replay refs for assertions
conformance/test/Conformance/Support/Temporary.hs: async,ioref,mvar — harness; owner=the TMPDIR examples in this file; lifetime=single example; entered/blocked coordination via MVars with the worker joined by withAsync and waitCatch; environment restored and owner released before the example ends
conformance/test/Conformance/Support/Withhold.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; withhold refs for assertions
conformance/test/fold-budget/Conformance/FoldFixture.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; fold-budget fixture refs for assertions
offchain/e2e-test/Singular/Registry/E2E/Fixture.hs: ioref,mvar — harness; owner=one e2e fixture session; lifetime=single example; serial registry lock via MVar with withMVar release; fixture refs for assertions
offchain/e2e-test/Singular/Registry/E2E/Fork81Spec.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; fixture refs accumulated for assertions
offchain/e2e-test/Singular/Registry/E2E/NodeSpec.hs: async — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; node and client run together under link withAsync, joined before the example ends
offchain/e2e-test/Singular/Registry/E2E/ReplayHistory.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; replay-history refs for assertions
offchain/e2e-test/Singular/Registry/E2E/ReplaySpec.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; fixture refs accumulated for assertions
offchain/e2e-test/Singular/Registry/E2E/SubmitSpec.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the submit examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial on the calling thread; the sends that reach the wrapped submission, its scripted answers and the archive heights seen at each acquisition, kept for assertions
offchain/private-facade/Singular/Registry/Private/Facade.hs: async,ioref — harness; owner=one facade session; lifetime=single session; archive and event refs serial under withAsync sessions that cancel and join their children before the next session starts; the harness must run node and client together
offchain/private-facade/Singular/Registry/Private/Smoke.hs: mvar — harness; owner=one smoke run; lifetime=single run; serial journal lock via MVar with withMVar release
offchain/test/Singular/CLI/CommandRunSpec.hs: async,ioref,mvar — harness; owner=the command examples in this file; lifetime=single example; entered/released/hold coordination via MVars with the command joined by withAsync and waitCatch; command refs for assertions
offchain/test/Singular/CLI/SubmitSpec.hs: ioref — harness; owner=one submit rig; lifetime=single example; serial on the calling thread; the sends, scripted answers, acquisitions, applied bodies and their chain points of the fixture chain, kept for assertions
offchain/test/Singular/Provider/Koios/FakeServer.hs: ioref — harness; owner=one fake-server session; lifetime=single example; serial; scripted-answer refs for the fake transport
offchain/test/Singular/Provider/Koios/ProviderSpec.hs: ioref,mvar — harness; owner=the provider examples in this file; lifetime=single example; entered/released/hold coordination via MVars with the loopback server joined before the example ends; provider refs for assertions
offchain/test/Singular/Provider/Koios/Scripted.hs: ioref — harness; owner=one scripted session; lifetime=single example; serial; scripted-answer refs for the fake transport
offchain/test/Singular/Registry/ContractMemory.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; contract-memory refs for assertions
offchain/test/Singular/Registry/ContractNode.hs: async — harness; owner=the contract examples in this file; lifetime=single example; oracle and wallet legs run under link withAsync, joined by wait before the example ends
offchain/test/Singular/Registry/ContractSuite.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; suite refs accumulated for assertions
offchain/test/Singular/Registry/DeploymentSpec.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; deployment refs for assertions
offchain/test/Singular/Registry/LineageSpec.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; lineage refs for assertions
offchain/test/Singular/Registry/LocalServicesCallerSpec.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; caller refs for assertions
offchain/test/Singular/Registry/PhaseLogSpec.hs: async,ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; independent example shards joined by mapConcurrently_; phase-log counts accumulated for assertions
offchain/test/Singular/Registry/RawChainFixture.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; raw-chain fixture refs for assertions
offchain/test/Singular/Registry/StubSession.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; stub-session refs for assertions
offchain/test/Singular/Registry/TrieStateSpec.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; trie-state refs for assertions
offchain/test/Singular/Registry/TxBuilder/BookEdgeSpec.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; booking refs for assertions
offchain/test/Singular/Registry/TxBuilder/BootSpec.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; boot refs for assertions
offchain/test/Singular/Registry/TxBuilder/MeasuredBookingSpec.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; booking refs for assertions
offchain/test/Singular/Registry/TxBuilder/UpperSlotSpec.hs: ioref — harness; owner=the examples in this file; lifetime=single example; serial; booking refs for assertions
offchain/test/Singular/Registry/WaitSpec.hs: async,ioref — harness; owner=the wait examples in this file; lifetime=single example; the interrupt probe runs under withAsync and is joined before the example ends; wait refs for assertions
offchain/test/local-services-record/ConfirmationProbe.hs: ioref — harness; owner=one probe run; lifetime=single run; serial; probe refs for the recorded evidence
offchain/test/local-services-record/ConfirmationSmoke.hs: async,ioref — harness; owner=one smoke run; lifetime=single run; HTTP confirmation driven under link withAsync, joined before the run ends; smoke refs for assertions
offchain/test/local-services-record/Main.hs: async — harness; owner=one record run; lifetime=single run; node clients run together under withAsync, joined before the run ends
